# ── Database dumps: NEVER commit ────────────────────────────────────────
# This repo is public (it serves novaxlogistics.com via GitHub Pages).
# A schema dump contains the service_role JWT in cleartext inside the
# shopify-status-push and web-status-push trigger definitions, plus every
# RLS policy and function body. Committing one publishes the keys to the
# whole database.
backend_dump*.sql
*.dump
db_dump*
supabase/.temp/
.env
.env.*

# ── Local scratch ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Any __-prefixed HTML is a local harness: these carry stubbed auth gates and
# seeded data, and this repo auto-deploys to novaxlogistics.com on push to
# main. __adminaudit.html sat untracked-but-not-ignored for a day because the
# old rules named files one at a time. Match the whole class instead.
__*.html
.DS_Store

# Data exports — contain merchant/consignee data, never commit
tickets_*_backup_*.csv
*_backup_*.csv
__client-test.html

# Homepage redesign prototypes. The canonical copies live on the
# prototype/light-homepage branch. Ignored on main because GitHub Pages
# serves main at novaxlogistics.com and every tracked file there is
# public -- committing these to main would put an unfinished redesign
# online. Ignoring them keeps the local preview working
# (localhost/prototypes/...) with no way to publish them by accident.
prototypes/
